  "_comment": "Source of truth for the misc register-tag vocabulary. Read by the build filter (scripts/wiktionary_filters.py filter_misc) AND the app render layer (MiscVocabulary.kt). See docs plan polished-wiggling-crab.md. The MiscCode enum + misc_* string resources live in Kotlin (compile-safe); the volatile data below (aliases / allowlists / gazetteer / denylist) lives here once. A unit test asserts every 'code' maps to a MiscCode and every register code has a string resource.",
